    "detailed_description": "Lost on an island in the middle of the ocean, after a shipwreck you'll have to find a way to get off the island. It sounds easy but it's not... you'll have to survive!<br />\r\n<br />\r\nYou will have to fight with the skeletons that chase you or even run away from them, collect all the items you can find, build a camp fire and cook some food. This will help you not starve! Build a hut because you will be staying on this island for a wile!<br />\r\n<br />\r\n- Pick up and collect items<br />\r\n- Build a Hunt<br />\r\n- Look for treasures<br />\r\n- Loot your enemies in online mode<br />\r\n- Buy and sell items<br />\r\n- Fight anything that gets in your way",
